mage. The `.min` and `.getD 0` therefore compute the minimum Roman weight.\n\n**Investigating radius computation**\n\nThe radius calculation uses eccentricity and analyzes how to compute it using a `minUpTo` function. The code also needs a formalization of ball definitions. This calculation is a significant part of understanding the radius, and potentially refuting the candidate statement.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"grep -rn \"theorem prove_\" /mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/","Cwd":"/mnt/home/japake298/project/GraphConjecturing/handoff/promising13/task_e20263a9","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Running command","toolSummary":"Search theorem prove_ in repo"}}]}
